   <sheets>
    <sheet>
     <plain>
      <text x="25.4" y="37.44" size="1.778" layer="97">ATtiny85 coin-cell T/H sensor node. Same pin-out as the stripboard build.</text>
      <text x="25.4" y="32.36" size="1.778" layer="97">No regulator: everything runs from the CR2450 (3.0 V fresh to ~2.0 V).</text>
      <text x="25.4" y="27.28" size="1.778" layer="97">C3 value from the coin-cell bench test (220-470 uF), low-leakage, near U3.</text>
      <text x="25.4" y="22.2" size="1.778" layer="97">C1 at U1 pin 8 and C4 at U2 VDD, as close to the pins as possible.</text>
      <text x="25.4" y="17.12" size="1.778" layer="97">Keep U2 at a board edge away from U3; slot the PCB around it.</text>
      <text x="25.4" y="12.04" size="1.778" layer="97">U3 pin order varies between STX882 modules: check yours.</text>
     </plain>
